# Day 10 – Domain Information Gathering Using WHOIS, DNSDumpster and crt.sh

## Objective

The objective of Day 10 was to learn passive information gathering techniques by collecting publicly available information about a target domain using **WHOIS**, **DNSDumpster**, and **crt.sh**. These tools help security professionals understand a domain's registration details, DNS infrastructure, and SSL/TLS certificate history.

> **Ethical Use Notice**
>
> All activities were performed using publicly available information for educational purposes only. No unauthorized access or active attacks were conducted.

